data: {"id": "22fe9472fff94631-thinking-parallel_evidence-1046", "run_id": "22fe9472fff94631", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "非常好！现在我有了关键证据。让我总结一下：\n\n**从 Pod YAML 中获取的关键信息：**\n1. Pod 处于 Pending 阶段\n2. 容器 `app` 的 `reason=CreateContainerConfigError`\n3. **关键错误信息**：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n4. 容器镜像：`xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n5. 命令：`python3 -c import time; time.sleep(3600)`\n\n**从 Events 中获取的信息：**\n- 49秒前，重复12次（2分45秒内），Warning 事件：`Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n\n**从 Logs 中获取的信息：**\n- 无法获取日志，因为容器处于 CreateCon", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789052097230, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

