data: {"id": "22fe9472fff94631-final", "run_id": "22fe9472fff94631", "seq": 1974, "ts_ms": 1789052128661, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9 的容器配置中引用了 Secret workload-input 中的 key unavailable-key，但该 Secret 实际仅包含 key available-key，导致 kubelet 无法获取配置并处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Phase: Pending | 确认 Pod 处于等待启动状态，无法进入 Running。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container `app` Waiting Reason: `CreateContainerConfigError` | 直接定位容器启动失败阶段在配置获取期。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | Container `app` Waiting Message: `couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 提供导致容器配置失败的精确错误描述。 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed` Event: `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 从 Kubelet 视角复现了获取 Secret 密钥失败的事件。 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\", container=\"app\"} = 1` | 独立于 K8s API 的外部观测，印证了当前的异常状态。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 状态、事件与 Prometheus 指标三方数据（#2, #3, #4, #5）高度一致，均指向 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态，并明确指出了错误源头是 Secret `workload-input` 中缺失 Key `unavailable-key`。因容器未启动，Log 和 Tracing 维度无法采集有效诊断数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nSecret workload-input 缺失 Pod 期望的 key 'unavailable-key' → Kubelet 无法获取容器配置 → 容器启动失败 (CreateContainerConfigError) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认的根因是 Pod 配置引用了不存在的 Secret Key。证据表明，Pod 容器配置中指定了从 Secret `workload-input` 获取名为 `unavailable-key` 的值，但该 Key 在目标 Secret 中实际不存在，导致 Kubelet 在拉起容器前因配置校验失败而终止启动流程（见证据 #3, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9: 50.3s (Evidence 43.0s, RCA 7.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 78.738, "metrics": {"run_id": "22fe9472fff94631", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 78.73539733886719, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 78735.39733886719, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 74448.42457771301, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 9961.293458938599, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3956.852436065674}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms":